<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Toxicity Red-Teaming: Benchmarking LLM Safety
<br class="ltx_break">in Singapore’s Low-Resource Languages</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Yujia Hu
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Singapore University of Technology and Design
</span>
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_email"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Email: </span><a href="mailto:yujiahu@sutd.edu.sg">yujiahu@sutd.edu.sg</a>
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Ming Shan Hee
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Singapore University of Technology and Design
</span>
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_email"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Email: </span><a href="mailto:mingshanhee@mymail.sutd.edu.sg">mingshanhee@mymail.sutd.edu.sg</a>
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
