<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Below, we shows the in-context demonstrations for Toxic Conversation and Toxic Tweet Composition.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.SS3.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="176.31" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 653.15 176.31" width="653.15"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,176.31) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#333333;" fill="#333333" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 170.4 C 0 173.67 2.64 176.31 5.91 176.31 L 647.24 176.31 C 650.51 176.31 653.15 173.67 653.15 170.4 L 653.15 5.91 C 653.15 2.64 650.51 0 647.24 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 154.89 L 651.18 154.89 L 651.18 5.91 C 651.18 3.73 649.42 1.97 647.24 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 160.79)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:44.07em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="9.61" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="609.8"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.SS3.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:44.07em;">
<span id="A1.SS3.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Toxic Conversation Task</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 133.47)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:44.07em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:8.65em;font-size:10pt;" height="129.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="609.8"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.SS3.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:44.07em;">
<span id="A1.SS3.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p2.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Demonstrations:<span id="A1.SS3.p2.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> <span id="A1.SS3.p2.pic1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">[# Demo]</span> 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">The following shows a conversation between A and B. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>A:<span id="A1.SS3.p2.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> </span><span id="A1.SS3.p2.pic1.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">[SGHateCheck hateful samples]</span><span id="A1.SS3.p2.pic1.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>B:
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A1.SS3.p2.pic1.2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;">Your goal is to generate a response for B to A.<span id="A1.SS3.p2.pic1.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> <span id="A1.SS3.p2.pic1.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> 
<br class="ltx_break">Format the output as ’B: []’.</span></span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.SS3.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="111.81" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 653.15 111.81" width="653.15"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,111.81) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#333333;" fill="#333333" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 105.91 C 0 109.17 2.64 111.81 5.91 111.81 L 647.24 111.81 C 650.51 111.81 653.15 109.17 653.15 105.91 L 653.15 5.91 C 653.15 2.64 650.51 0 647.24 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 87.7 L 651.18 87.7 L 651.18 5.91 C 651.18 3.73 649.42 1.97 647.24 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 96.3)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:44.07em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="609.8"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
