</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 63.59)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:44.07em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:3.6em;font-size:10pt;" height="59.42" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="609.8"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.SS4.SSS1.p3.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:44.07em;">
<span id="A1.SS4.SSS1.p3.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS4.SSS1.p3.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">A: Malay people all should get out of our country.
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.SS4.SSS1.p3.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;">B: Ya lah, Malays all stupid one, only know how to bring burden to our country.</span> 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">A: Trans people are idiots. 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.SS4.SSS1.p3.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;">B: You even more like that idiot than them lor!</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
